    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ikūjo kwīyīngīla hekalu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nahayūlola nūlībona ī ligūlū a higūlya ya mitwe ya Makelubi, ū kwigūlya yalyo shalīho shiikolanījo sh'isumbī lya būtemi lya mawe ga safilo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ūng'wīla ū munhū ūyo walī azwalile shizwalo sha kitaani, “Jaga ū mu madandali ū mu sīlīlī ya Makelubi, ūkagookaje makala ga moto a makono gako kūfuma ū mu Makelubi, ūkagamiizūle ū mu nzengo.” Ūja mo ng'hana nalībona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Makelubi gaalī gīmīīla lwande lwa dakama; ū munhū ng'wenūyo aho waaja moi, ī gwalugwa ya mu gatī yookala ilunde. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī likanza lyenīlo ī likūjo lya ng'wa SEEBA lyīnga a ha Makelubi, linunga ng'wigūlya; hūna lyūja ha būshikīlo bo ha nyango go hekalu. Ī hekalu yookala ilunde, nī libīndo lyeela pe kūlw'ikūjo lya ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī lilaka lya mfuutumo gwa manana ga Makelubi lyashikaga kwibīndo lya hanze, lyalī gītī kūhamuka kwa ng'wa Mulungu wa Būdūla ūlū alīlūngalūnga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wanagīla ū munhū ūyo walī azwalile shizwalo sha kitaani, “Solaga moto kūfuma ū mu madandali ayo gakūpilimaga, kūfuma ū mu Makelubi,” ū munhū ng'wenūyo akaja mo ūūkīmīīla hihī n'idandali līmò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna līmò lya Makelubi lyūgoloola nkono ū kū moto ūyo gwalī ū mu go. Lyūgwahula ū moto lyūntūūlīla mu makono ū munhū ūyo walī na shizwalo sha kitaani. Wahayūgwanukūla ūfuma hanze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Ū mu mangwa ja manana ga Makelubi, gaali ga kūbiza gītī makono ga banhū.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho nalola nūbona galīho madandali anè gihelile na a Makelubi, būlī Ikelubi n'idandali līmò. A madandali genayo gaang'wekaga gītī kilisolito. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu būnè wago pye a gose gaalī giyikolile; būlī lyene lya gītī idandali mu gatī y'idandali līngī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū galīselema gajaga būlī kwene ū mu mhandī inè ūko galolelile a Makelubi. A madandali gaalī gatagalūkaga ūlū galīja ipandī lyose lyose a Makelubi, ūko gūūlolela ū ntwe. Gaalī gatagalūkaga ūlū galīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mibīlī yaago yalī ījimile miso pye a hose, kū ngongo, mu makono, na a manana; pye na a madandali gago. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nigwa a madandali galīhayiwa, “Madandali mapilimūki.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Makelubi a gose būlī lyene lyalī na būshū būnè: Būshū būmò walī w'ikelubi, ū bo kabīlī būshū bo munhū, ū bo kadatū būshū bo shimba, ū būshū bo kanè bo ng'hoonà.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Makelubi genayo gūbūūka igūlya gīnga a hasī. A genaya hū shaalī ī shiseeng'wa shipanga īsho naalī nashibona kū Mongo gwa Kebali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Makelubi aho gaselema, na a madandali gūselema ūmo gaalī gihelelile nago, na haho a Makelubi gaagoloola a manana gago gīkī galale gajile, a madandali gatīngile aho gaalī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Makelubi ūlū gīmīīla galembeela, na a madandali gīmīīlaga galembeela; a Makelubi ūlū gabūūka ng'wigūlya, na a madandali gaabūūkaga hamò nago; nguno ū moyo gwa shiseeng'wa shipanga gwalī ū mu madandali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī likūjo lya ng'wa SEEBA lyīnga a ha būshikīlo bo ha nyango go hekalu, lyūja lyūkalembeela higūlya ya Makelubi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Makelubi gūgoloola manana gago gūjūūdūka a hasī nalolile, gūlala gajile, na a madandali galī hamò nago; gūūkalembeela ha wingīlīlo wa mita gwa kīya gwa numba ya ng'wa SEEBA; nī likūjo lya ng'wa Mulungu wa Isilaeli lyalī a higūlya yago. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shenīshi h'ī seeng'wa īsho naalī nashibona ha sīlīlī ya ng'wa Mulungu wa Isilaeli kū Mongo gwa Kebali; nakadeeba gīkī gaalī Makelubi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būlī shene shalī na būshū būnè na manana anè, hama ū mu mangwa ja manana gasho gaalīmo ga kūbiza gītī makono ga munhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī suso ja būshū washo jaali gīt'ūmo naalī naabonela kū Mongo gwa Kebali. Būlī shene ūlū shilīsegeja shajaga kū būtongi dūhū.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
